# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .dockerignore – ERPNext Fork
#
# The Dockerfile clones all app source from GitHub at build time,
# so almost nothing from the local working tree needs to be in the build
# context. Only the docker/ helper scripts are COPYed from the local repo.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Exclude everything …
**

# … except the docker/ helper directory
!docker/
!docker/**
